<description>&lt;p&gt;President Salva Kiir lifted the state of emergency in four states ahead of the 2027 elections while ethnic violence continued, including gunmen opening fire on a Juba-Mundri vehicle that injured two passengers. In Wau town fighting erupted and clashes in Lakes State left seven dead, and a SPLM chairperson-elect in Western Equatoria dismissed reports of an attack on his residence. The UN warned that hunger is worsening sharply because of conflict and El Niño, and survivors of gender-based violence still lack essential medical care, illustrated by a rape victim walking four hours for treatment. 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQeUlqcGI2RkxmUFBtOE9GNlBZYmtQdF9tMUtoWWE1S3JodFpOdHNIZHU3WlhfWlFaMVRJNmZjZlY3dDhWY25uZ0NSRXhmUVhScmptaVk1R3pVcmhhcmpuWW53OFhVa3JhTjc0THRsLXlpZFQ5RGdLSi1MeE5HRmhLc0VqUmVxMDVjOThwMWFKWXBjOUJvc1BXYzAxNnFEYkNCbURRcldn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPeExHSlFyZkVkaVItZVRMaW1nM2hHSkdvMUNjdV9yRUo0UHBFY01qNTRweGRuRVlEVjJ1bXd3ZWQ2ek05MmZhUjFaaFBoejVTc09XWWstSC1DQl9vRzdJRThFWjh4cTBhaXdMZkxtcl9LR0tqaTBIcDRmSW9JYmUxSXpsNENWbkFDM1IwbjBiWDBNYU9qMUMxNzJrSXpibU1SdjdSbUFVbmZoWEdKenQ1WWRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Українські Національні Новини (УНН)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNc2JQYnFoOFk3N2NscG8tc21UcnF5VjBGcFpZWDJlSWJ5eTdGYTNzeURWM2JuaHZFVGF1U2Qwcm91UE1na244am40ZllVZXhtNGVtQWR4aW9KLTVzaWhqSkdiRW1ndTJfdEJzbWE2ZnNvczhkR3lEYzRYUHBxSGlxLWpjTlUwd3FBMXNpMWpyemZKMkc2YVFLOEpkUjEzLWU2T0lYT1dxZURjT3I1ZnMwamw3U0lGcmNpclYwSTBKRHRlckpS?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles